module Core

### Represents the protocol for in-place subtraction.
### `InPlaceSubtractable` is for mutable values whose subtraction operator
### updates the left-hand operand rather than allocating a new result.
protocol InPlaceSubtractable
  ### Subtracts `you` from this value in place.
  ### The right-hand operand should remain unchanged.
  ### :param you: The value to subtract.
  @writable
  routine Me.$isub(you: Me)
